OL,3,GNEWSALife-saving PC to sell 'rare'
OL,4,Abravery medal set
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer who risked his own
OL,7,Flife to rescue a vulnerable woman from
OL,8,Fa bridge nearly 30 years ago is selling
OL,9,Fthe medals he received for his bravery.
OL,11,FThree Royal Humane Society (RHS)
OL,12,Fawards, presented to former Avon and
OL,13,FSomerset Police officer PC Ian
OL,14,FStanderwick, are expected to fetch
OL,15,Fbetween #6,000 and #8,000 when they are
OL,16,Fauctioned next month.
OL,18,FStanderwick was honoured after a
OL,19,Fdramatic rescue next to the Clifton
OL,20,FSuspension Bridge in Bristol on 8
OL,21,FSeptember 1997.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
