OL,3,GNEWSALife-saving PC to sell 'rare'
OL,4,Abravery medal set
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is thought to be the only time the
OL,7,FRHS has presented all three medals for
OL,8,Fa single rescue, and Standerwick said
OL,9,Fhe wants them to go to someone who
OL,10,F"will ensure my award is remembered and
OL,11,Fcontinues through time".
